 use default value of sidecar_index i.e. -1\r\n[2] access of sidecar index without checking whether sidecar exists in op — pg_client_session.cc:341 . As part of this call, we have implicit conversion int64_t to size_t.\r\n\r\nFYI, this issue only exists for cache setter case which was added in this diff - https://phabricator.dev.yugabyte.com/D17824\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1449051562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bmatican","id":395011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTAxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican","html_url":"https://github.com/bmatican","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":8632247172,"node_id":"MEE_lADOBlCVUc5fjagOzwAAAAIChaOE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/8632247172","actor":{"login":"karan-yb","id":4623304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjMzMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4623304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-yb","html_url":"https://github.com/karan-yb","followers_url":"https